EN:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}I thought I was being neighborly,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
but I suppose you have better
things to do, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Komşuluk edeyim demiştim,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
ama belli ki yapacak daha önemli
işlerin var, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}I thought it'd be fun to get
together. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}You know, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}just us girls.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}But maybe some other time.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Me apetecía pasar un rato contigo,
cariñín, y hablar de cosas de chicas.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Dejémoslo para más adelante.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Das wär bestimmt lustig geworden!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Ein kleines Damentreffen. {{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Nun gut,
vielleicht ein andermal!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Birlikte vakit geçirmek hoş
olurdu. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Hani, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}kız kıza.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Ama başka sefere artık.
